<stack-static>
    <statement><p><p>Baraka expanded <m>(x + {2})^3</m> by multiplication. His working has one mistake.</p><p>Line 1: <m>(x + {2})^3 = (x + {2})^2(x + {2})</m></p><p>Line 2: <m>(x + {2})^2 = {x^2+2 x+4}</m></p><p>Line 3: he multiplied the terms of line 2 by <m>x</m> and by <m>{2}</m> in a grid:</p><tabular border="1" style="border-collapse:collapse;text-align:center;"><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>\times</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>x^2</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{2 x}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{4}</m></cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>x</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{x^3}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{2 x^2}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{4 x}</m></cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{2}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{2 x^2}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{4 x}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{8}</m></cell></row></tabular><p>Line 4: So <m>(x + {2})^3 = {x^3+4 x^2+8 x+8}</m></p><p>(a) Which line has the mistake?</p><div>[ Line 1 | Line 2 | Line 3 | Line 4 ]  </div><p>(b) Write the correct expansion of <m>(x + {2})^3</m>.</p><div><fillin characters="30" name="ans2"/>  </div></p></statement>
    <solution><p><p>A cube is the square multiplied by one more bracket. Check each line: the square must have the middle term <m>2 \times {2} \times x</m>, each cell must be the product of its row and its column, and like terms must be added.</p><p>(a) The mistake is in Line 2. Baraka left out the 2 in the middle term: <m>(x + {2})^2 = {x^2+4 x+4}</m>.</p><p>(b) The correct working is <m>(x + {2})^2 = {x^2+4 x+4}</m>, then</p><tabular border="1" style="border-collapse:collapse;text-align:center;"><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>\times</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{x^2}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{4 x}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{4}</m></cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{x}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{x^3}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{4 x^2}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{4 x}</m></cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{2}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{2 x^2}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{8 x}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{8}</m></cell></row></tabular><p>so <m>(x + {2})^3 = {x^3+6 x^2+12 x+8}</m>. Check: <m>x = 1</m> gives <m>{3}^3 = {27}</m>.</p></p></solution>
    <answer><p>Line 2</p></answer>
    <answer><p><m>x^3+6 x^2+12 x+8</m></p></answer>
</stack-static>